note=\"86c3a123f8ca1262\" href=\"?note=86c3a123f8ca1262\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures\">14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a> 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T\">\\(\\mathbb T\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b995af55a8b210ce\" href=\"?note=b995af55a8b210ce\" title=\"14-df-geometric-theory-models\">14-df-geometric-theory-models</a> 的有穷几何理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E))\">\\(M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal E))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^*M=\\operatorname{Inv}_f(M)\">\\(f^*M=\\operatorname{Inv}_f(M)\\)</span> 的正式构造见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"86c3a123f8ca1262\" href=\"?note=86c3a123f8ca1262\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures\">14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f^*M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal F)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f^*M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb T}(\\mathcal F)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 X.3 Corollary 6，印刷 p.537。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f2895e14ad640cde\" href=\"?note=f2895e14ad640cde\" title=\"14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance\">14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance</a> 给出每个几何公式子对象的拉回等式；逆像保持包含，故每条理论序列在 f*M 中成立。只需有限余极限及像保持，无需 F、E 为 Grothendieck。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-theory-models","status":"resolved","id":"b995af55a8b210ce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-theory-models]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category","status":"resolved","id":"fc5aaf8518e020c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance","status":"resolved","id":"f2895e14ad640cde","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-geometric-formula-inverse-image-invariance]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures","status":"resolved","id":"86c3a123f8ca1262","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-many-sorted-topos-structures]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f=(f^*,f_*):\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-morphism]] 的几何态射；所有全忠实、保守条件均相对于这两个已绑定的范畴。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-theory-models","status":"resolved","id":"b995af55a8b210ce","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb T$ 为 [[14-df-geometric-theory-models]] 的有穷几何理论，$M\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathrm{Mod}_{\\mathbb 